<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CENBANK SETS 13 WK STATE FUND BILL AUCTION.</title>
<headline>CZECH CENBANK SETS 13 WK STATE FUND BILL AUCTION.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank on Monday set an auction offering 1.2 billion crowns in 13-week bills of the National Property Fund for Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said that the limit price and yield for the auction would be announced on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
